        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rudolf Hess, Fredric Warburg, George Orwell, Adolf Hitler\n- Publications: the publication published by Fredric Warburg\n- Events: Hess's flight to Scotland, Orwell stopping serving Hitler\n\nFacts:\n- In May 1941, Rudolf Hess, aged 43, reportedly made an illegal flight to Scotland.\n- Fredric Warburg published the publication whose editor was George Orwell.\n- The report about Rudolf Hess's flight was the reason George Orwell stopped serving Adolf Hitler in 1941.",
